<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">PHP - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">PHP - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">PHP - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHP - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Ire bǝn nga Bulus bǝn Timoti, agɛn abɛ Kristi Yesɔ. Gar bǝn aner abɛ Arik bɔbɔk nǝ Filibi ndi ayi nǝ min kɛ Kristi Yesɔ, bǝn angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ akabaŋkɔŋ bǝn abɛ lɔk tama:<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Arik Tetɛɛ amɔr ben Yesɔ Kristi abɛ nek zhin iki didik ben sɔŋ kǝ sǝk.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne ben Arik ne atu ayi abɛ tɔ cɛr maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />M nyɛr Arik amuŋ ne atu min kɔte kpaŋ takɛ mte lǝlɛ min ne susun muŋ; <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />bǝn kɔte kpaŋ takɛ mben Arik nɛ atu min bɔbɔk, mben Arik nǝ nyɛr <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />ne ir keŋ ndi izhin nǝ lɔkmǝ ma ne ndum kɛ lɛ didik kǝ men vuŋ rɛ bɛr kuti tǝ nye mkpaŋ kǝŋe. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Neme mnǝ zhi tǝ Arik, waŋ ndi ne vuŋ ndum didik kǝŋe bǝn abɛzhin, atei gli kǝ gar klɛtu nǝ ber yi nyɛ Kristi Yesɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Izhin yi nǝ susun muŋ kɔte mkpaŋ ta kɛ! Fe ire ankyak tǝm wɔ ndi mna nɛ tu min. Tǝ izhin bɔbɔk nǝ yi bǝn abɛm nǝ ta zhɔk yiŋ ndi Arik nɛ nǝm nɛ kǝ, kɔ ndi azǝzaŋa myi ne jaru bǝn mkpaŋ keŋ ndi mne yi isha tǝ nkli mgbamgbaŋ ne lɛ didik kɛ Arik tǝ mbla kǝ anenen. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Arik ayɛ ayi amuŋ tǝ mnǝ blaa zhin zub ndi mnǝ ndi iyi nǝ susun muŋ min ngɔŋ irɛ bǝn Kristi Yesɔ ne tu maa. <verse eid="PHP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Mben Arik te nyɛr min bǝ flu tena flu tetɛk, bǝn izhi ilɛ kɛ zub ben ambuk anenen, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />te izhin bɛ zhi hria iki yiŋ ndi yi didik naŋ. Fe izhin te yi tsetser ba nuŋ atei na nab zhin ivǝn ŋɔk ba ne bɛr nyɛ Kristi. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Itsen min itei shak ne iki didik yi na izub ndi Yesɔ Kristi wa ankyak anai, nǝ nǝk ngɔŋ bǝn gbar Arik asak.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="PHP 1:11">Iyi ne ivli ai Kristi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:11">Nga Bulus mwɔb te izhin bǝ zhi, amunya, te iki yiŋ ndi ne vuŋ me ne duŋ ilɛ kɔte ti. <verse eid="PHP 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />M wɔb tǝ ijin bǝ zhi, akpa amuŋ, tǝ iki yiŋ ndi ne vuŋ me nǝ duŋ lɛ didik kǝ men kɔmɔ nǝ ti. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Neme, bɔbɔk abǝ blɛ amkpa nǝ tǝ ambuk ben iki aneshir anuŋ ne zhi te myi ne jaru te myi gen ayi Kristi. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Neme iyi nǝ jaru muŋ nǝ nǝk abǝ zǝ Arik mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ zhɔk susun bǝn Ŋgɔŋ, te duŋ ba ayi ne klik susun kɛ du lɛ kɛ Arik yaŋ te sǝsǝk.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Neme anuŋ ne min mǝne adu ilɛ Arik ne ankiŋki ben wɔb akla, ama anuŋ adu kɛ ne susun didik. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Iyiŋɛ ina amɛ ne nyɛr akpa, te zhi te Arik ne nǝm ndum kɛ duŋ lɛ didik kǝ men maa ikɔ ne ti. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Anuŋ ba du lɛ kɛ Kristi susun didik ba, ama ne susun kɛ te bubu; ayik te di aba te duŋ me yik iyah ngɔŋ ndi myi ne jaru. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Bai ki yi lɛn susun ba! M nyɛr ne ki mɛ, neme ne du lɛ kɛ Kristi kɔte nkɔŋ takǝ, kɔ kai susun mimin kɔ kai susun didik. Fɛ M ntei zǝn nyɛr, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />te mne zhi te ne ben Arik ben ilɔk maa ndi ire ben Izhu tsetser yi Yesɔ Kristi atei tam zhɔk. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Ishur ayi muŋ ngɔŋ ben zhɔk susun muŋ iyi bam tǝi na ndum muŋ tǝ gburkli nɛ ankɔŋ ba, ama ne kɔte mkpaŋ take, ne amɛ ma azǝzaŋa, M tei yi nǝ klik susun, te duŋ mkuŋ kpa muŋ bǝ duŋ sak kǝ Kristi yi ngɔŋ, kɔkai tsitsir kai ku. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Tǝ anii yi vli? Bǝn abem, ayi Kristi. Ayi Kristi. Iku, fe, itei gli nkimɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Ama ate yi ndi itanyɛmɛ nǝ ivli kǝ kpa kǝŋe mtei mla nǝna ndum, fena bam ne zhi tǝ mbaŋ itayi ba. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Ikiki ya ivuŋ me gli. Mwɔb te mbǝ yi ne ivli te bɛ na yi ben Kristi, itayi itei rem naŋ; <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />ama ne atu min ire tǝm yi tsitsir. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Mnǝ zhi iyiŋe, ina yi amɛ mnǝ zhi tǝ mtei nkli. M tei kli bǝn abezhin bɔbɔk, tǝ nyaŋ nǝ li ti min tǝna nyɛr nǝ tanyɛmɛ, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />te mte na yi ben abɛ zhin, izhin te yi ne iki ŋɔr asa ne atu muŋ ne tsin min ben Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="PHP 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Azǝzaŋa, iki didik yi ire tǝ izhin bǝ tsǝn nɛ ankɔŋ awaŋ ndi lɛ didik kǝ men kǝ Kristi ne bla, tǝ kɔ mte nyɛ yik zhin kɔ bam tǝ nyɛ ba, M tei wɔ te izhin kli gbamgbaŋ ne iki zhiin ben bine min te izhin bɛ nǝk atu amin ir keŋ ndi tanyɛmɛ ne susun min ne lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Kǝr zhin bǝ tǝ sǝsǝk abǝ tǝ zɔr bǝn abezhin ba; kɔtǝ mkpaŋ takǝ izhin bǝ nak tsǝ kli, iyiŋɛ tei duŋ ba zhi tǝ atei suk kɔka izhin tei li, tǝ ayɛ Arik wa anǝk zhin ili ru. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Te nɛ nǝk izhin mkpaŋ kɛ na Kristi ndum, ba ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu ankyak ba, ama tǝna yik iya nǝ atu maa. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Azǝzaŋa izhin te zǝm tsik mgbu kǝŋe. Ai mgbu ir zhiin ndi zhin ne yik me zen tsik kɛ ne kpaŋ kɛ gayir, fe izhin ne zhi te mnak ri zen tsik kɛ.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Izetu zhɔk ben inǝk ŋgon kɛ Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Itsen min ben Kristi iduŋ zhin klik, nyɛr maa inǝk zhin sik susun. Izhin bǝ binetu ben Izhu, izhin bǝ na lɔk akpa tena lɔ susun kɛ akpa. <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Mblazhin, fena, tǝ duŋ me nyɛr ngɔŋ ndi ta yi itsǝn zhiin, tǝ yi nǝ nyɛr akpa zhiin, bǝn na yi ki zhiin nǝ susun bǝn dur. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Kǝr zhin bɛ na ikinuŋ ne so tu kɔ ne ankɔŋ ane ŋur asa, ama izhin bɛ zi tu zhɔk akpa, izhin bɛ baŋ nuŋ anaŋu. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Izhin bɛ tɔ iki yi na inuŋ, kǝr inuŋ abɛ tɔ iki na maa ankyak ba. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Itsǝn min ibǝ yi ndi kɛ Kristi Yesɔ:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Ne naga baŋ ikpa kɛ Arik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">Bane te wa abɛ yi anenen ndi Arik ba. <verse eid="PHP 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Ndi nǝ yi ame, nǝ tanyɛmɛ maa nɛ nǝk iki yiŋ ndi ayimɛ neyi bɔbɔk, tɛ baŋ kpa kǝ gɛn. Nɛ baŋ kpa kɛ neshir. <verse eid="PHP 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Ne zi tu maa zhɔk tɛ tsǝn nǝ nǝk tu tǝ gar mkpaŋ kɛ ku maa nǝ kpɔk kuŋkun kɛ gɛn. <verse eid="PHP 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Neme Arik nɛ lǝgu nǝ bɛ tɛ nǝgu ngɔŋ tɛ nǝgu isak kǝŋ ndi inaŋ kɔte sak takǝ.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Neme, ne nek isak kɛ Yesɔ ŋgɔŋ maa kɔte iki yi vli tei ne gbarshu, ne mimi, ne igɔŋmimi itei tara agbarum, <verse eid="PHP 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />bǝn bɔbɔk atei ru akli ndende tɛ di Yesɔ Kristi ai Ŋgɔŋ, tǝ bɛ yi gbar yɛ Arik tetɛɛ ŋgɔŋ maa.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilaŋ ndi lu kɛ laŋ ne gɔŋmimi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Fena, akpa amuŋ, ir keŋ ndi izhin zǝ lɛ muŋ ndi mnǝ yi bǝn abɛzhin, itǝ rɛ izhin bɛ zǝ lɛ muŋ inaŋ ndi bam yi bǝn abɛzhin ba. Izhin bǝ na ndum kǝ tazhin zhɔk ne zitu zhɔk tǝ na hria zhin ayi, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />te Arik azǝn na ndum ben abɛ zhin te izhin bɛ nek tu tena zi ilɛ maa.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Izhin bɛ na kɔte nii ne yaŋ lɛ ne susun kɔ mumur, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />te izhin bɛ yi tsetser te kǝr abɛ na nab zhin nŋɔk ba ndi amumun abɛ arik ndi ne shaga, ndi ayi ne gɔŋmimi kɛ cɔkla tena na zumimin. Izhin bǝ duŋ ilu min laŋ ne miŋ men ndi cinces ilaŋ ne gbarshu, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />te gli zhin lɛ kǝ nǝk vli gbamgbaŋ. Izhin tǝ na amɛ, M tei yi nǝ iki yi ŋur asa bǝn abǝ zhin ne bɛr nyɛ Kristi, te tsar tedi inǝk tu bǝn na ndum muŋ ba yi sha ba.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Mkpaŋ nuŋ azhizhi anǝ kpa muŋ abɛ kɔg ahrie ndi anǝ tsǝk baŋ nǝ tanyɛmɛ min bǝn Arik. Ate yi ndi iyi amɛ, mnǝ nyɛr te duŋ susun muŋ men bǝn abɛzhin bɔbɔk. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Ne ankɔŋ azhin awaŋa, izhin min yi bɛ wɔ men ne susun te zǝme zhin nyɛr.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti bǝn Abafaroditas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Ate yi ndi waŋa ai na yi Ŋgɔŋ, me zhɔk susun tǝm shar Timoti bǝn abɛ zhin andanda, te susun muŋ bɛ men ndi mte wɔ lɛ ne atu min. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Ai wa kiki maa ndi awɔ ir keŋ ndi mwɔ ne kpa muŋ izhin na yiu ne susun. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Bɔbɔk nki aneshire anak nek atu ne iki yiŋ ndi idam ba ankyak, ba atu ayi Yesɔ Kristi ba. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Fe izhin nǝ tu min nǝ zhi tǝ Timoti ne tsar tu maa iwa ai ner didik, nga bǝn iwa, ta yi ndi tetɛɛ bǝn vǝn, ta nǝ na ndum biŋ bǝn abɔu kɛ du lɛ didik kǝ men. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Me zhɔk susun te bɛ sharu ben abɛ zhin andanda ndi mte yik ikiki tsin anenen bǝn abɛm. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Tǝ Mnǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Ŋgɔŋ tǝ nga muŋyi mbǝ nyɛ bǝn abɛzhin andanda. <verse eid="PHP 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Mǝne na yik ire tǝm shar Abafaroditas izumɔr bǝn abɛzhin, waŋ ndi nɛ na ndum tɛ na kliim nǝ ŋɔk tɛ na yi ndi inǝ shar amin nǝ lɔk ma. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Awɔb tǝ wa abe yik zhin bɔbɔk min nemɔ tǝ izhin ne wɔ tedi ane lɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Amɛ ne lɔ ndi atei ku. Ama Arik ne lɔ susun maa, bane atu maa ankyak ba te vuŋ nga muŋ yi, te kǝr bɛ lɛn susun te na lɛn susun ba. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Me wɔb tem bɛ sharu ben abɛ zhin, te izhin bɛ yigu tena nyɛr, ilɛn susun muŋ itei dɔ: <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Ta zhin ne wu, fe, ne nyɛr ndi nǝ zǝ Ŋgɔŋ. To zhin ne wu shak ayi ndi nki aneshir, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />tǝ nɛ nǝk tu maa ndi ai ku ne atu ayi kristi, te abe nam iki yiŋ ndi ijineba ibe nǝm.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Tsetser kǝ zub</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Ne klɛtu, akpa amuŋ, izhin bɛ nyɛr ne zǝ Arik min. Ina cɛr zhin iki yiŋ ndi neka cɛr zhin neyi bai iki ngɔŋ bene abɛm ba, ina amɛ itei yi iki didik bǝn abɛ zhin. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Izhin bɛ hria ayi ben abɛ na ikiki mimin, ane viu, abɛ yak akpa men. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Ai taba ne kɔk ta zǝk ikɔk didik bai aba ba, te ta zekur Arik ne Izhu maa te nyɛr ne tsin mɔr kɛ zǝ Kristi Yesɔ. Bata zhik gɔŋ ne iki yi yik ayi ba. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Nga, iyemɛ, M zhik tanyɛmɛ muŋ nǝ ikiki yiŋɛ. Ate yi ndi inuŋ ate yik tɛ di wa atei ya zhik gɔŋ ne kiki yi yik ne ayi, nga me yi ne nkuŋkɔŋ yi na ame naŋu. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Nɛ kɔk me zǝk ndi mǝne te sati zhiin ne ŋli. Me yi awɔ ne Isrela ne ŋli, ne nga ŋli kɛ Banyami, Me yi awɔ ne Ibraniyawa ne azhizhi. Tǝ na zǝ icɛr yi Musa, Me yi awɔ ne Ferisawa, <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />fe mǝne nǝk tu ngɔŋ nǝ nǝk abǝ zǝ Kristi iya. M nǝ yi tsetser ne zǝ cɛr yi Musa, tǝ na yi nǝ yaŋ lalɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Ama ne ikiki yiŋ ndi mbǝ yi ne ikinuŋ yi yaŋ ne tu mɔ ba ne yi ikinuŋ ben abɛm ba ne atu ayi Kristi. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Bane ikiki yuŋɔ ankyak ba; mne baŋ yi ayi ki sha bǝn abɛm ntei tsarǝ ne iki ŋgon ni zhi Kristi Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amuŋ. Nǝ atu maa mne tyak kiki bɔbɔk tyak hrie; Mne baŋ yi bai ai kinuŋ ben abɛm ba, te mbǝ yi ne kristi <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />tǝ mbǝ nyaŋ bǝn abɔu mgbamgbaŋ. Bam yi tsetser kɛ tu muŋ ba, iyiŋ ndi ire ben zǝ cɛr iyi Musa. Myi tsetser ne ben tanyɛmɛ yi susun ben Kristi, itsetser keŋ ndi ire bǝn Arik ne tanyɛme yi susun. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Iki yiŋ ndi mwɔbǝ tǝ mbǝ zhi Kristi tǝna zhi mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ lu ne bɛ maa, te bena yi ne miŋ kɛ yik iyah maa te bena yi ndi maa ne iku maa, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />ne shur ayi yiŋ ndi nga muŋ yi atei lɛk me ne bɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itsikli te yik iki yiŋ ndi uwɔbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Bam yik te di mne ka yik iki wɔb muŋ ba kɔ mne shaga. ama m tsi kli tem yik iki yiŋ ndi Kristi Yesɔ neka vuŋ me yak itu maa. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Neme, akpa amuŋ, bam yik te di mne ka vuŋ iki me ba; iki zhiin iyiŋ ndi mna, me ŋursuk ne iki yiŋ ndi ne ka gayir te nek tu ne iki yiŋ ndi iyi ne ti. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Ne me, mnǝk tu ŋgon ne iki yiŋ ndi iyi ne ti muŋ te mbǝ ta idǝk muŋ ne Igbarshu, ndi Arik ne zhɔm ne atu ayi Kristi Yesɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Bɔbɔk mɔr ndi ta nǝ ka cɛ nǝ zhi lɛ kɛ Arik ta bǝ na ir kǝŋe. Ama ate yi ndi anuŋ ne miŋ min ayi ne iki nuŋ kaŋkaŋ ne susun, Arik atei bui aŋyak zhin ndende. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Ate yi ndi amɛ, ta bɛ tsin amɛ ne ir keŋ ndi tane men yime. <verse eid="PHP 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Izhin bǝ zǝ ki yi naa muŋ, akpa amuŋ. Izhin bǝ tɔ abaŋ ndi azǝ iki yiŋ ndi ta ne bla zhin neyi. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Mǝne men bla zhin iki iyiŋe amkpaŋ tetɛk ayi gayir, fe azǝzaŋa mtar bla zhin ne yi nɛ amayi: Anuŋ tetɛk ayime itsǝn mǝnɛ iduŋ ba ayi abɛ tǝ zɔr ne iku Kristi ne kpɔk kuŋkun kɛ gɛn. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Atei yir ilu ne klɛ tu men, te arik amǝne ai kiki bubu yi wɔb men. Aŋur asa ne iki yi shisha men, fe ayik tedi asusun men ayi ne ikiki yi gɔŋmimi kǝŋe ankyak <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Ama atei taba tayi amumun abǝ shu, ta zhɔk susun te ŋub ne ta ta zhɔk, Arik Yesɔ Kristi, ndi atei rɛ Igbarshu. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Atei sɛn kpa mɔr kǝŋe ndi klu aŋin te duŋǝ ayi ndi kpa maa kǝ nǝk ngɔŋ, te na ndum ne mgbyamgbyaŋ maa keŋ ndi atei Gli ikiki bɔbɔk aŋyak ne angus amaa.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Inǝk lɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Neme, akpa amuŋ, izhineba ba ndi m nyɛr zhin mshur ayi bǝn abɛ zhin! Izhin iduŋ m nyɛr, mŋur asa bǝn abɛ zhin! fɛ, izhineba amunya, izhin bɛ tsi kli mgbamgbaŋ nǝ zǝ Arik.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Afodiya bǝn Sintiki, tɔba, mben zhin, tsǝ kli tǝ wɔb zhin sɔŋ kǝ keke nɛ akpa ndi amunva nǝ zǝ Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Fe iwa mi yi, ikpa muŋ didik nǝ tanyɛmɛ, mwɔb tǝ ubǝ lɔk amba abaŋa; tǝ nɛ zǝm ana ndum ngɔŋ nǝ du lɛ didik kǝ men, te bǝn Kilɛmas bǝn anki akpa amɔr abǝ na ndum, abaŋ ndi ne cɛr asak amen ne mplɛ cɛr kɛ vli.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Izhin bǝ nyɛr ne zǝ Arik min. Mna bla: nyɛr zhin!<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Izhin bǝ tsar itsǝn didik min nɛ akpa. Arik asɔŋ anyɛ andanda. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Kǝr izhin bɛ duŋ asusun amin acok ala nǝ kinuŋ ba, ama izhin bǝ ben Arik nǝ iki yiŋ ndi izhin wɔ bɛ, izhin bǝ benu nǝ susun kɛ nyɛr. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Fe isɔŋ kǝ sǝk kɛ Arik, ikǝŋ ndi inaŋ zhi neshir, itei duŋ asusun amin bǝn idur min bǝ yi bǝn Kristi Yesɔ.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Nǝ kletu, akpa amuŋ, izhin bǝ duŋ asusun amin abɛ shak ne ikiki didik iyi gbar asak: ikiki yi zub, inǝk itu, anenen, tsetser, nyɛr akpa, bǝn inǝk ngɔŋ. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Izhin bɛ na ndum ne iki yiŋ ndi izhin ne zhi tena tei bǝn abɛm, ka ayi lɛ muŋ ka ayi iki na muŋ. Fe Arik waŋ ndi anǝk ta sɔŋ kǝ sǝk atei yi bǝn abɛ zhin.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne Nyer nǝ iki yiŋ ndi Filibiyawa nɛ gliu neyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Nǝ tsǝn muŋ bǝn Ŋgɔŋ iki nyɛr ngɔŋ bǝne bem ndi nǝ baŋ mkpaŋ tǝ izhin ne na yik mkpaŋ kǝ tsar nyer me. Bam ndi zhin ne duŋ nam iki didik ba, ba zhin ne yik mkpaŋ kɛ na ma ba. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Ama bam ndi amɛ te mwɔb ikinuŋ bǝn abɛ zhin ba, te mne zhi ir keŋ ndi me tei sɔŋ ne yi ne iki ben sɔŋ yaŋ iki. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Mne zhi ir keŋ ndi asɔŋ yaŋ iki bǝn sɔŋ ne yi ne iki tetɛk. Mne zhi ir kɛ sɔŋ amɛ, te kɔte amɛ bǝn kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ, m nyɛr ne iki yiŋ ndi me yime neyi, nǝ hri bǝn ikasa, iyi ne iki tetɛk bǝn watsɔb. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />M tei na kɔte ni yir nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ keŋ ndi kristi ne nǝm ne kɛ.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Ama inǝ rɛ ndi izhin ne lɔk ma ne iya muŋ. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Izhineba anɛr abǝ Filibiya izhin bǝ zhi ngɔŋ tǝ ndi mnǝ nduŋ Makidɔniya ne bɛr yi kuti ndi mnǝ du lɛ didik kǝ men, ai zhineba ankyak abǝ zǝ Kristi ndi ne lɔk ma; ayi zhineba ankyak nǝ biŋ bǝn abɛm nǝ yi nǝ iki bǝn iyaŋ iki. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Inaŋ mkpaŋ azhiin ndi Mne yi nǝ Tasalɔnika, mne wɔb te abɛ lɔk ma, izhin ne shaar mǝ nǝ ikiki. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Bam wɔb tǝm ta kiki min ba, ama, mwɔb te izhin bɛ yik ikinuŋ iyaŋ ne yiŋ ndi izhin yime neyi. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Neme, izhin ne yam bɔbɔk te naŋ iki yiŋ ndi abɛ yam! Myi ne bɔbɔk iki yiŋ ndi mwɔbǝ azǝzaŋa ndi Abafarodita ne gliim ishar min. Iyi ndi iki yi yɛmgbɔ shushum yi nǝk Arik, ibaŋ yiŋ ndi ne tei te na nyɛr. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Fe nǝ bɔbɔk nǝ adudunki tǝtǝk izǝ bǝn Kristi Yesɔ, Arik amuŋ atei nǝk zhin ikiki bɔbɔk iyi wɔb min. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Igar bǝn Arik amɔr bǝn Tetɛɛ bǝ yi gbar iyaŋ klɛtu bǝn iyaŋ klɛtu! Bǝ yɛmɛ.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itǝk iyi klɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Mtǝk kɔtǝ ŋɔ nǝ min anɛr abɛ Arik abaŋ ndi ayi abǝ Kristi Yesɔ. Abǝ zǝ Kristi abaŋ ndi ayi bǝn abɛm atǝk zhin. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Bɔbɔk anɛr abɛ Arik atǝk zhin, ciŋ abaŋ ndi ayi abǝ kɔb Kesar.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Itazhɔk iyi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi ibǝ yi bǝn abɛ zhin bɔbɔk.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>